        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "type": "text", "text": "The chart shows one complete 10 by 10 tile. Each marked cell is one stitch worked over two threads of the evenweave (one hole to the next). Repeat the tile in both horizontal and vertical directions to fill the desired area. The tick marks at every 10 stitches on the printed chart help you keep count." }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Working the piece" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "orderedList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [{
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Mount the fabric in the hoop. Find and mark the centre." }]
            }]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [{
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Thread two strands of DMC 310. Work the horizontal runs of each diamond row first using Holbein stitch, travelling left to right." }]
            }]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [{
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Return along each row, filling the gaps to complete the Holbein double-running pass." }]
            }]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [{
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Work the diagonal sides of each diamond in the same two-pass method." }]
            }]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Finishing" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "type": "text", "text": "Wash in cool water, press face-down on a thick towel, and frame or mount. Finished size at 28-count: each 10-stitch tile measures approximately 9 mm. A 40 by 40 stitch area measures approximately 7 by 7 cm." }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "What to try next" }]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "type": "text", "text": "The diamond fill sits at a medium density. Try the lattice fill for an open result or the square knot fill for a denser one." }
        ]
      }
    ]
